{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/85540c2dff5b4822f9e5fbaeb94ad7b6.avif?t=1762179685\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a journalist as you uncover a mystery of a small town in Eastern Europe. Deduce and complete puzzles as you explore and uncover more articles in a sprawling wikipedia-like database.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/86c349d70c2f8b51fcbb81015bb0f57c.poster.avif?t=1762179685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/86c349d70c2f8b51fcbb81015bb0f57c.webm?t=1762179685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/86c349d70c2f8b51fcbb81015bb0f57c.mp4?t=1762179685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/f70820d5492e0c7ebeec3f2e0f7f7523.avif?t=1762179685\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the dots of these interconnected web of articles. Use your skills of deduction to figure out the mystery and report back to your anonymous source. By completing puzzles, you\u2019ve already gained knowledge for your next conundrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/5a59678fc8871abdc21965794b2f743d.poster.avif?t=1762179685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/5a59678fc8871abdc21965794b2f743d.webm?t=1762179685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/5a59678fc8871abdc21965794b2f743d.mp4?t=1762179685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/f2aedaef05c1134d259a99ebfc4d8fe4.avif?t=1762179685\" width=1000 height=200 /></span><br>Something is wrong with the town you\u2019re investigating. Flags continue to show as you delve deeper into their database. Figure out the connections, and the story will be laid bare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/f5608664ff7acfe6600c2804f725bb65.poster.avif?t=1762179685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/f5608664ff7acfe6600c2804f725bb65.webm?t=1762179685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/extras/f5608664ff7acfe6600c2804f725bb65.mp4?t=1762179685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018950?t=1762179685","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018950?t=1762179685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/cfa57aafa5a1dfe01347af04d1f5c9d4e6f8d21f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762179685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018950/cfa57aafa5a1dfe01347af04d1f5c9d4e6f8d21f/ca